{"version":1,"content":"<p>亞姐出身的郭金，雖有小楊恭如之稱，但星途平平最終返回內地發展，淡出的她早年轉而翡翠珠寶生意後變得富貴。</p><p>近年不時於社交平台分享生活照，但網民卻指她判若兩人，雖然皮膚保養不錯，但髮線後移靚樣不再，現年52歲猶如60多歲富貴大媽。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.106229+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T04:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:14.963581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:14.963581+00:00","content_hash":"b8675def450d276b6dcc51eb2c32d3a3b9f609b69d220da673f541296b88dcd5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}